      "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* 改进 TUN 路由排除与启动就绪检查 by @johnymoo in https://github.com/yanue/V2rayU/pull/1681\r\n* 增加 TUN 应用与进程路由规则 by @johnymoo in https://github.com/yanue/V2rayU/pull/1683\r\n* Fix workspace sleep and wake notification observers by @Harviewang in https://github.com/yanue/V2rayU/pull/1685\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @johnymoo made their first contribution in https://github.com/yanue/V2rayU/pull/1681\r\n* @Harviewang made their first contribution in https://github.com/yanue/V2rayU/pull/1685\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/yanue/V2rayU/compare/v5.1.0...v5.2.0",
